    "text": "By WIS News 10 Staff ,\n1 days ago COLUMBIA, S.C. (WIS) - Richland One’s annual “Sportsarama” high school football jamboree is going through some schedule changes. The district announced Tuesday that, due to high temperatures this weekend, the start times for Sportsarama on Friday and Saturday have been pushed back by an hour. This means... Read full article\n4",
